window.products.push({"id":417011,"name":"MAXICOZY Faux Fur Throw Blanket, Soft Fluffy Sherpa and Fleece Blankets, Comfy and Fuzzy Plush Throw, 50\" x 60\", Cozy Machine Washable Throws for Bed,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N7GM7hDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SOFT AND FLUFFY FABRIC]: Stitched from 100% polyester faux fur and 100% polyester sherpa, the throw blankets do not shed or accumulate fur, while the stitches are durable. The fleece blanket is comfortable, lightweight, warm, and suitable for all seasons. [LUXURY ELEGANT TEXTURE]: Available in 5 colors and measuring 50\" x 60\", our soft blanket blend aesthetics and practicality to complement a variety of decorating styles and adorn your home perfectly. This sherpa blanket will give you a new tactile experience full of comfort and warmth. [WIDE RANGE OF USE SCENARIOS]: This throw blankets will keep you warm and comfortable even in outdoor conditions. Our fuzzy blanket is portable and suitable for sofa, bed, cinema, home stay or any occasion. The fluffy blankets also make the perfect personal gift and can be used as a photography prop to take beautiful photos on your social media apps. [MACHINE WASHING AND EASY CARE]:The plush blanket will not deform easily even if it is washed in a washing machine. Please wash this faux fur throw blanket alone in cold water on a gentle cycle and dry on a very low setting. It is sincerely recommended that you wash and dry the comfy blankets before using it for the first time. [100% SATISFACTORY SERVICE]: We're pretty sure you'll love our fur blanket, but if for some reason you're not happy with the fur throw, you just need to return the furry blanket within 30 days for a full refund. We are committed to providing you with a nice shopping experience, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N7GM7hDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXICOZY","source_asin":"B0B68GVY5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B68GVY5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B68GVY5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417012,"name":"Personalized Mermaid Reversible Sequin Pillow, Custom Unicorn Sequin Pillow for Girls (Pocket Pillow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nukgm7TRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a fun decorative touch to any room with this PERSONALIZED Unicorn Pocket pillow! These make great gifts for friends, or just for yourself! Pillowcase is available in 3 sizes:16\"x16\", 18\" x 18\" or 20\" x 20\". This pillow features two individually stitched pockets on the front, perfect fit for a favorite toy or book. This vibrant full-color design is printed on the front AND back of your pillow, and features a hidden zipper along the bottom. PLEASE NOTE: The more letters in your name, the smaller the text will need to be so that your name can fit across the center of the pillow.  Product Care: spot clean only  Package Includes: 1 pillow cover. Stuffing can be added for additional $15.  Quality Guarantee & 1 Year Warranty We appreciate the opportunity to serve you and stand behind the quality of our products with our US based team! We offer a quality guarantee and 1 year warranty. Some exclusions apply. Personalized Packaging The ultimate gift experience with custom personalized packaging for every made to order product. Create an experience they'll remember! Wow factor guaranteed! PLEASE NOTE: We are a family business and we reserve the right to not print obscene, disrespectful, inappropriate or abusive content as we deem fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nukgm7TRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VeraFide","source_asin":"B07B1T4N86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B1T4N86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B1T4N86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
