window.products.push({"id":417082,"name":"XINFULL 8 Pack Wire Storage Baskets Household Metal Wall-Mounted Containers Organizer Bins for Kitchen Bathroom Freezer Pantry Closet Laundry Room Cab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ez7T81tVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package includes & Size: Set of 8. 4 Large 15.0*5.9*5.5 inches, 4 Medium 11.0*5.1*4.7 inches. Include 8 adhesives. Enough capacity for space organizing, suitable for bathroom, kitchen, laundry, etc.WALL-MOUNTED STORAGE: Easily attach the organizer to your wall. The stickiness of adhesive is strong, don’t worry about the Wire basket moving easily. Also can withhold amount of weight. No drilling required, easy installation. NOTE: Adhesive works on ceramic tile, glass, granite, stainless steel and any smooth surface. REMOVE GUIDE: Use hair dryer to heat the sticker, tear it off.IMPROVE STORAGE & ORGANIZATION: Use these storage bins to organize your pantry, kitchen, bathroom, office, craft room, garage, bedroom, entryway, or closet. These versatile storage baskets work in any room, holding a variety of items without bending or buckling under the weight. Sturdy steel basket support fruits, vegetables, pantry items, snacks, spice bottles, folders, magazines, toiletries, makeup, face wash, shampoo, conditioner, tools, craft supplies, and so much more. NSTANT ORGANIZATION: This bin keeps kitchen clutter under control by storing all of your essentials. Store and organize pasta, packets, salt dressing and vinegars, macaroni and cheese boxes, water bottles, soda pop cans, juice boxes, snacks, pouches, onions, apples, baking supplies, and condiments. Large sized, you will find many uses for these storage bins.FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE: The perfect solution for organizing a multitude of items hats,scarves,video games,laundry needs,craft supplies and more,whether you use it to hold produce,guest towels,extra bath supplies,snacks,toys or accessories, you’ll be able to grab the items you need quickly and easily. Use in bathroom, bedroom, closet, laundry room,utility room,garage,hobby and craft room,home office,mudroom and entryways. Perfect for homes,apartments,condos,college dorm rooms,RVs and campers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ez7T81tVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINFULL","source_asin":"B08PC1BP4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PC1BP4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PC1BP4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
