window.products.push({"id":417207,"name":"Laundry Basket Collapsible Laundry Baskets for Laundry Room Bathroom with Durable 600d Double-Layer Oxford Cloth 82L Capacity Black WHOOA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Htnehd7pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity】Size is 38cm(L) x 72cm(H) The 82L high-capacity laundry basket provides a large space for all of your family's laundry, including clothes, sheets, and towels. Cylindrical shape type makes a smaller footprint and saves space. It can be folded up when not in use and stored in the gap between washing machines. 【Durable and Sturdy】 The double layer of sturdy fabric prevents it from being torn or falling over, so it can stand on its own even if it is not filled with items. 【Excellent Material】The use of 600d Oxford cloth make the laundry basket water and stain resistant, and to keep odors and moisture away from clothes.Aluminum ring with anodic oxidation treatment, making the appearance more smooth and bright, with a sense of fashion and wrapped by soft rubber, make your use more comfortable. 【Applicable Scenarios】 Large laundry basket can solve many storage problems and can be used in bedrooms, living rooms, bathrooms, nurseries, etc. 【Cautions】 Special material, please do not wash in the washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Htnehd7pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOOHA","source_asin":"B08BZH63TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZH63TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZH63TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417208,"name":"JOZEFINA ATELIER 04C Dolce Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHgstZoSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Jozefina Factory was founded in 1982 by Jozef Jankowski, a well-known artist and glass blower. His daughter-Ella Jankowska Fishman has emerged as a leading glass designer. Her designs bring a breath of freshness to the art glass world. Jozefina Art Glass Atelier is recognized worldwide as a leading European manufacturer of hand blown art glass combining sophisticated, classical and contemporary design with highly skilled craftsmanship. Inspired design, expressive style, beautiful and elegant shapes make our art glass unusual and innovative. Each piece is hand blown and hand finished which makes every item artistic and unique. At Jozefina we value the old, traditional techniques of glass blowing dated back as far as the 10th century. We are located in Krosno-Poland, the oldest glass and crystal producing area in Europe. The artistic skill of fine art glass blowing has been passed down through the family generations. Our masters glass blowers create art rarely found today. We are delighted to introduce a wide variety of shapes and vibrant colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHgstZoSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOZEFINA ATELIER","source_asin":"B00N66I9PI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N66I9PI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N66I9PI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
