window.products.push({"id":417212,"name":"HOMirable LED Lighted Christmas Decor Pine Needles Sled Sign for Home Wooden Rustic Sleigh Holiday Hanging Sign Winter Snow Decorative Farmhouse Ornam","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XSJX97PWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔔EXCLUSIVE DESIGN - LED Xmas sign is handmade with attention to quality and detail. The combination of LED lights and pine needles gives you a different visual experience, embellishing your home with Christmas color. Colorful details, it looks great to place anywhere in your home. Requires 2 X AAA battery power (battery not included). 🔔MULTIPLE DECORATION - Holiday Decor comes with a natural rope for easy hanging on the indoor wall, door or any where you want to hang. Suitable for home, living room, dining room, Christmas and party, instantly creating a charming festive atmosphere. 🔔CREAT FESTIVE AMBIANCE - The Holiday Decor add more holiday atmosphere to your home and spread the merry Christmas joy all over your house and make your family and friends happy to celebrate the holidays! 🔔PERFECT ADDITION - Bring a touch of countryc, retro, rustic feel indoors with our Christmas Wall Art Sign. Hang it or place it on the mantelpiece, or wherever that needs a piece of cheer. It's perfect to hang on your front door or celebrate Christmas and winter in your home, with wooden signs to enhance your Christmas decor and add holiday fun. Dimensions 17.8\" x 12.2\" 🔔CHRISTMAS PRESENT - Christmas Decor makes for an ideal holiday gift for friends or families, and gather with them to celebreate. Nothing says Christmas like our Christmas Wall Plaque. It will make a great decor addition to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XSJX97PWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMirable","source_asin":"B0BGZ463Y6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGZ463Y6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGZ463Y6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417213,"name":"OBKOJJ Round Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Ice Container, Tong and 6 Beer Openers, 212PCS Ice Ball Maker Mold for Freezer, BPA Free Sphere Ice Cube Trays","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7177TK2e8aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE 212 ICE BALLS AT A TIME! – The package of the round ice cube maker mold for freezers includes 4 round ice cube trays (each with 53 sphere ice ball molds) with lid comes with a large capacity ice ball container and an ice tong. There are also 6 beer openers included, so you can enjoy your beer at any time! You can make up to 212 ice balls at a time for parties and store the rest for further use for drinks, tea, cocktails, whiskeys and coffee SAFE & DURABLE MATERIAL – Made of food-grade BPA-free plastic material, this ice ball maker molds set is safe for direct contact with food and durable for long-time use. It can withstand low temperature without deforming, and will not emit any harmful element during prolonged use, suitable for making ice cubes for the drink for adults and kids. EFFORTLESS & EASY TO RELEASE – Unlike other round ice cube trays made of silicone that’s soft and gets deformed easily, OBKOJJ sphere ice cube trays for making ice balls are made of plastic, which will not change shape when put in the fridge and allows for easier release, making it possible to make perfect ice balls for your summer chilling drinks. USER FRIENDLY & EASY MAINTENANCE – To make perfect ice balls with OBKOJJ round ice cube trays with lid is easy. Just fill the ice cube tray with water, the close the lid with gentle pressure to allow access water to flow out from the small holes on each sphere mold, then put the ice cube trays into the freezer. When done using, you can simply wash the ice cube trays with clean water. WIDELY USED & 100& SATISFACTION – Thanks to its user-friendly design and large capacity, our round ice cube tray is perfect for making ice balls for party and drinks. You can get really creative with your ice cube tray and make delicious ice balls by filling it with whatever drink you prefer! All the round ice cube maker mold with bins come with 1-year warranty. If you have any question about this ice ball maker mold set, please feel free to contact us, we are always ready to help you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7177TK2e8aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBKOJJ","source_asin":"B09XQGLLZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XQGLLZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XQGLLZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
