window.products.push({"id":417217,"name":"FantasyDay 9'' Lily Flower Birthday Cake Mold Silicone Baking Molds for Your Anniversary Cake, Soap, Cookie, Donut, Bread, Loaf, Muffin, Brownie, Corn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mh1ZLKP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create delicious chocolate treats and special desserts or homemade soaps from the comfort of your own home. Now with this chocolate mold, you can design your own chocolates for gift boxes or party trays. Silicone Dessert Mold Features: - 100% food grade silicone dessert molds, DIY mousse cake molds. Top white and Top Soft silicone molds, heat resistant from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit. - Great flexibility, such silicone mousse cake molds won't crack or break like classic hard plastic mold, durable and long lasting. Flexible and easy to clean, making these cute silicone candy molds with your kids. - Silicone molds for baking can use as mousse molds, cake molds, ice cream molds, mousse cake molds, pudding molds, baking molds, dessert molds, truffle molds, food molds and more. Use Tip: 1. When you make the cake, please do not pure full cake slurry into the mold, just make it 3/4 full. The cake will expand when making. 2. When you get the molds and first time to make cake or chocolate. First of all, please fill the water in the molds and put into the microwave or oven transfer for 1-2 minutes, then drain. 3. After baking, please remove the molds out of the oven, and place in the baking rack until the molds completely cooled. Specification: Material: 100% Food-Grade Silicone Color: White Package Included: 1 Pack Silicone cake mold. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We focus on providing, high quality, cost-effective products and services. 30 days money back and lifetime warranty with no question asked. If you're dissatisfied with purchasing our silicone baking molds for any reason, contact us for a replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mh1ZLKP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FantasyDay","source_asin":"B074QG978W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074QG978W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074QG978W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
