window.products.push({"id":417238,"name":"Ideal Home Range Dinner Napkins Disposable 3-Ply Paper Hand Towels, 8.5\" x 4.5\", Please Use (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MEJh-ryCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"16-Count paper napkins measure 8.5 x 4.5-inches, ideal for dinner tables and buffets or as guest towels in the powder room. Napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. Create dynamic tablescapes and stunning place settings by pairing Ideal Home Range's patterned napkins with matching plates and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. For weddings and cocktail parties to summer BBQs and everyday use, choose from a variety of designs just right for your next event or get together. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers; napkin tissue is 100% cellulose from cracked wood (fallen trees) and plantation wood (managed forests where trees are planted specifically for the production of paper materials) and all tissue is oxygen bleached without the use of chlorine. IHR ink is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German food and health laws and the US FDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced. IHR has earned a certificate of approval from the forest Stewardship Council (FSC), a prestigious certificate only awarded to those who meet all of the FSC's standards for sustainability, forest management, well being of the forest workers and effects on indigenous peoples and the local environment. Ideal Home Range is exclusively represented in the United States by Boston International and is considered to be the international market leader and trendsetter in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MEJh-ryCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B0BSX4TW7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSX4TW7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSX4TW7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
