window.products.push({"id":417255,"name":"AILINYUWEI Grey Velvet Curtains for Living Room - Thermal Insulated Luxury Soft Velvet Drapes Room Darkening Curtains for Bedroom W52 X L63, 2 Panels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eH4LGnWEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Exquisite workmanship】Package includes 2 panels of W52\"x L63\" luxury velvet curtains. Each curtain panel built-in grommet(1.6\" inner) design which allows hanging on most curtain rods. Make your living room and bedroom more luxurious with the velvet curtain. 【Light Blocking】The curtains for living room are made from premium quality velvet fabric which is soft, thick quality. Our window curtains can block most sunlight, help to establish a dark and cozy environment for enjoying better sleeping and providing privacy. 【Luxury Look】AILINYUWEI Grey velvet curtains are soft, silky, drapery, and feel very nice to the touch. The velvet curtains can effortlessly fit into any house style to make your room look more exquisite and elegant. Perfect for living rooms, bedrooms, dining rooms, and kids' rooms curtains. 【Multi-function】Creates an ENERGY-SAVING insulating barrier against heat and cold, keeping your room cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter. Meanwhile, protect your furniture and floors from sun espouses. 【 Easy Care】The velvet drapes are machine washable (gentle cycle) with cold water. Please use mild detergent and no bleaching. Tumble dry on low, Iron at low temperature if needed. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eH4LGnWEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AILINYUWEI","source_asin":"B09NNL4TGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNL4TGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNL4TGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417256,"name":"evron Corner Mounting Shelf,Easy to Install Wall Corner Shelf,Set of 2 (Black Frosting Pattern Right-Angled)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXtQFVQmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A good fixture to give your room more life with your art boutiques and favorite decoration. Easy to locate when need.Great space saving shelves by changing your room corner into a useful storage section.Each wall shelf has a area of around 435 square cm and is more than enough to display books, CD, plant terrarium, photo frame and etc.They are manufactured from high quality ABS materials (NOT MADE OF WOOD) . Easy to assemble and install: Installation Method (A) Need to drill holes for mounting the shelf. A1. Select the suitable height of the wall corner, keep the shelf sides clinging to the wall corner and parallel the shelf surface with the ground , use pencil to mark 4 positions clearly on the wall. A2. Use the 6mm drill bit to drill 4 holes on the pencil marks, use a hammer to impact the plastic expansion pipes into the 4 wall holes. A3. Tighten the 4 screws with a screwdriver, while tightening the screws in halfway, make sure to place the shelf in the position of the screw mount followed by lock the screws tightly. Installation method (B) Self-adhesive installation, no drilling requires. B1. Select the appropriate position and height, clean the wall, take off the protective layer, stick the self-adhesive tapes as per the direction of the arrow. B2. Make sure that the screw mount position on the shelf and the screw on the adhesive tape is to fit one into the other. B3. Lock screws tightly. Note: cementitious mortar surface,wall paper, latex paint surface will affect the loading capacity, it might leave marks on the the wall surface when remove the adhesive tape. Installation Method (C) Direct placement, no installation is required. Choosing wall corner with supporting platform in place, you can use directly with the flat surface. (Note: The corner shelf at this point is movable, move carefully)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXtQFVQmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"evron","source_asin":"B07N6CFH1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N6CFH1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N6CFH1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
