window.products.push({"id":417327,"name":"Bunny Cupcake & Cake Holder Pedestal Stand, Ceramic Dessert Plates for Snacks Cookies, Bunny Candy Dish Gift, 8 Inch White, Easter Birthday Party Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sNxSjI6LL._AC_.jpg","description":"A beautiful choice for an elegant baby shower or festive birthday party, our Bunny Cake Stand is a wonderful way to serve desserts, pastries, and other treats on your special day. This adorable three-legged ceramic stand provides a stylish way to enhance any party environment. It will complement any table setting, and the elegant look makes it perfect for serving cakes of all kinds for birthdays and other festive occasions. Up your dessert presentation with this new and improved glass crystal footed cake stand. Throw the tea party of your dreams. Display delicious desserts atop this beautifully handcrafted ceramic cake stand. Go ahead and Bedeck this bunny-inspired stand with scallop-frosted cakes, sprinkle-covered cupcakes, and fruit-stuffed tarts. With its adorable 3 bunny design, it can be used as a decorative piece on your dinner table or buffet table to showcase food items in a new way. This ceramic dessert stand is the perfect accent to your table, whether you’re hosting a baby shower or a birthday party. This piece displays beautifully and adds elegance to any event and is great with kids. The ceramic bunnies are sure to catch the eye of friends and family. Measures 8\" in diameter and the beautiful design gives this cake stand an uniquely cute look for any event. The focal point of any table, this cake stand will elevate your dessert to create a stunning presentation your guests will always remember! This cake stands bring a modern, decorative touch that makes your sweet treats look even sweeter! Use as an impressive gift item for weddings or baby showers and more! Beautiful is the first word that comes to mind when you see this elegant glass cake stand. It will surely be a perfect addition to any special event or party. This beautiful ceramic cake stand is perfect for topping off your favorite desserts and special occasion treats. Bring an adorable, cute, and beautiful touch to your table with this gorgeous stand for desserts. Put it on your kitchen counter, dining room table or bar cart for festive occasions or everyday use. Perfect for weddings, weddings, baby showers, bridal showers and more! These stands are versatile enough to work on their own or in conjunction with other pieces for a beautiful display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sNxSjI6LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gute","source_asin":"B09TFTY2MB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TFTY2MB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TFTY2MB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
