window.products.push({"id":417403,"name":"moroccan poufs Leather Luxury Ottomans footstools Maroon unstuffed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y9BzKtj1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Moroccan leather poufs are a must have for any room of your home and our now available on pre order in my store I have one in every room of my house including the bathroom because you know someone always wants to chat about something when you are trying to relax! These authentic leather ottomans have so many uses around your home, they can be a footstool or used as extra seating, from the living room to the bedroom to the kids playroom. All of these leather poufs are individually made by artisans in Morocco and ethically purchased using fair trade. After sourcing and buying the goat skin, it is cut and hand painted or dyed, then sent to the outskirt of Marrakech to be stitched and finished with silk embroidery by local Moroccan women to show off expert craftsmanship and a result that is durable and will stand the test of time. There are five people involved in making each pouf and it takes up one day to complete it. They are all wonderfully unique, with subtle variations in the colour of the leather and will look beautiful and last for many years to come. Below are all the colours I have in store but if there is a colour you love and you don't see it here, please send me a message and I'll see what I can do size dimension:20 to21 inch high : 12 to 13 inch note: we only sell cover pouf not stuffed pouf coz it cost for extra money shipping We sell retail and wholesale Feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y9BzKtj1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"moroccan poufs","source_asin":"B0193G5W6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0193G5W6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0193G5W6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417404,"name":"70th Birthday Gifts Decorations for Men or Women, Party Conversation Toppic Card - Fun Facts from 70 Years Ago, Gold Foil Stamped (Unframed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y4Fjt90aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As birthdays and anniversaries are coming up, have you considered what gifts you should buy for your romantic partner, family, or friends? Have you considered what would make them feel that their birthday or anniversary is unique?A delicately printed poster is perfect for decorating your house for a party or when giving gifts! This exquisite item will enhance your event by creating an ideal and unforgettable experience. Our ‘Back In’ posters will encourage you to recall events that occurred during a particular year, as well as remind you of important historical figures and popular trends, so you can feel nostalgic about your past. Are these posters the unique gift you need for your loved ones’ and family’s birthdays and anniversaries? Product Information: Gift Packaging: 1 x Gold Foil ‘Back in 1952 Print’ with Exquisite Kraft Envelope Design: A gold foil and white lettering paired with a black layout gives your poster a refined look. It will make your birthdays and anniversaries more memorable. Dimensions: This 11 x 14 inch poster is suitable for any 11 x 14 inch photo frame. Wide Range of Uses: Whether they’re for your birthday parties, wedding anniversaries, or classmates’ gatherings, these posters are a perfect accessory that will enhance your experience. They’re not only ideal tabletop centerpieces, but also eye-catching wall decorations. You can put these anywhere you want, and can even hang them up on the ceiling. Our posters will make you feel nostalgic. They’re an ideal conversation starter that’ll remind you, your romantic partner, family, or friends of interesting things from the past. They’ll spark conversations among you and your loved ones, and encourage you to discuss topics like sports or popular music. Let us help you cherish your life’s enjoyable moments! Please click ‘Add to Cart’ to purchase our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y4Fjt90aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InstaDecor","source_asin":"B0B4P3QRDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4P3QRDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4P3QRDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
