window.products.push({"id":417435,"name":"Procizion Digital Multifunction Kitchen Food Scale Bundle with Measuring Spoons, Cleaning Cloth and Batteries Measures up to 11 Lbs Backlit LCD (Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zjOpIl6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you been looking for the perfect kitchen scale? One that is accurate, lightweight, reliable and easy to use? Look no further - the Procizion food scale with its elegant black tempered-glass surface is exactly what you have been looking for. Whether you are preparing a special meal or measuring your food for your weight loss program, this kitchen scale delivers. No longer do you need to subtract the container weight to calculate your food and ingredients, the Tare feature instantly calculates the net weight of the ingredients (and automatically subtracts the container weight to calculate the weight of the ingredients being weighed). Accuracy - This scale is extremely accurate. You are measuring your ingredients for a reason; your gram scale must be accurate! This digital kitchen scale is equipped with 4 new, high-precision GFX sensors. This scale provides accurate measurements from 0.1 oz. to 11 lbs. (1 gm - 5250 gm) with a bright blue large backlit LCD. Your kitchen is a place where the family gathers, a place where magic happens. Sleek, sophisticated and beautiful, your Procizion touch scale is sure to bring compliments from your guests. Combining new advanced, touch-sensitive buttons, a tempered glass surface and new GFX sensors, this scale is one of the industry most advanced digital food scale. The Procizion scale combines all this technology into a contemporary thin design and stands out as a showpiece for the modern kitchen. Designed for the culinary perfectionist and constant bakers who desires superior accuracy and beautiful design, this scale is one of the lightest kitchen scales on the market and offers easy portability.Chefs and Calorie Counters: your lives just got a whole lot easier! Thanks to the Procizion Scale, you can now follow your recipes to the “T” and know exactly what size your portion is.Note: This product is packed in frustration free packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zjOpIl6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Procizion","source_asin":"B01M6ZSFGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M6ZSFGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M6ZSFGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
