window.products.push({"id":417499,"name":"KRAFTIZAN Moroccan Leather Pouf Ottoman Foot Rest – Handmade Ottoman Leather Pouf – Genuine Leather Boho Round Ottoman Pouf Crafted by Moroccan Artisa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IM+ucBvmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ OTHER MOROCCAN FLOOR POUF SEATING is often LACKING IN QUALITY, with DISAPPOINTINGLY POOR CONSTRUCTION. At Kraftizan, our leather ottomans and poufs are HANDMADE BY SKILLED MOROCCAN ARTISANS trained in the art of traditional ottoman seat making. Each STURDY, DURABLE boho pouf is handmade with care, with a THICK GENUINE LEATHER that holds its shape and won’t leak pouf stuffing. ★ UNLIKE OTHER OTTOMAN DECOR made of ROUGH, CHEAP LEATHER MATERIALS (which sometimes emit a strong, UNFORTUNATE SMELL), our eco-friendly floor round pouf is made of PREMIUM SOFT GENUINE LEATHER. Every puff ottoman comes with made-easy STUFFING AND CLEANING INSTRUCTIONS, to keep your ottoman foot stool looking clean and VIBRANT for years to come. ★ A BEAUTIFUL PIECE OF HISTORY IN YOUR HOME! The aptly named ottoman dates back to the Ottoman Empire, and has been used for seating in homes since the 13TH CENTURY. Our traditional Morrocan decor for home features the 8-pointed star, used in ancient civilizations as a SYMBOL OF REGENERATION and wholeness. Choose between a wide selections of ELEGANT AND VIBRANT COLORS: Beige, Brown, White, Black, Red, Mustard, Blue and Gray ottoman. ★ ADDS A BOHEMIAN TOUCH to any room in the house – our boho accent chair works perfectly in any room, enhancing your decor with a TOUCH OF MOROCCAN SPICE. Makes an ideal HOUSEWARMING GIFT – or round ottoman for living room, seating for bedroom ottoman, kids ottoman for playroom or nursery ottoman, even a floor pouf ottoman for your walk-in-closet! Our pouffe ottoman puff chair instantly ELEVATES ANY ROOM with its exotic boho home decor design. ★ AT KRAFTIZAN, WE’RE PASSIONATE ABOUT the traditional beauty of MOROCCAN DECORATIVE ARTS, and work meticulously to BRING IT TO LIFE in our own products. Here in our home country of Morocco, our network of SKILLED ARTISANS and SMALL COOPERATIVES pour their skills, history and heart into our poufs for living room. We believe in CONSCIOUS COMMERCE, donating 10% OF OUR BUSINESS PROFITS to those in need, and actively protecting Mother Earth by ELIMINATING POLLUTION in our production process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IM+ucBvmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRAFTIZAN","source_asin":"B08P12Y35C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P12Y35C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P12Y35C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
