window.products.push({"id":417540,"name":"VANZAVANZU Bathtub Stickers, 24 PCS Non-Slip Bathroom Bathtub Shower Stickers, Safety Treads Adhesive Decals with Scraper for Slippery Bathroom Tubs S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KtBUV9GIL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"★ Diamond Grain & Anti-Skid Treatment: This bathtub stickers is designed by diamond grain. The surface adopts stereoscopic texture to increase friction, safe to use, don't worry about slipping. The anti slip bath tub stickers works the same way as the bathtub mat, but it does really lighter, easier to use, and easier to maintain. ★ Eco-Friendly Material: Bath tub sticker is made of high quality PEVA material, which is transparent, soft, wear-resistant, non-slip, waterproof, non-fade, strong viscosity, environmental. It is also safe to use, easy to remove, and residue free. ★ How To Use: Please clean the surface where you want to stick the anti-slip tape and keep it dry before applied, and then peel of the anti-slip sticker treads from the protective paper to stick. After pasting, press the anti-slip treads gently to make it more firm and stand for 12 hours. ★ Suitable For Various Places: Anti-skid transparent adhesive safety treads can be used in bathroom, bathtubs, shower rooms, stairs, floors and more, improve traction and safety on all kinds of slippery surfaces for your beloved (Just works for smooth area). ★ Package Includes: 24 pieces clear sticker, 1 high-quality silicone scraper. You can play and enjoy your bath time even if in the smooth surface because the possibility of falling can be greatly reduced by these safety stickers. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions and problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KtBUV9GIL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANZAVANZU","source_asin":"B089W86YG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089W86YG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089W86YG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
