window.products.push({"id":417634,"name":"Uieke 30 Pack Christmas Glitter Berries Stems for Christmas Tree Decorations, 7.8\" Artificial Christmas Berry Picks for DIY Crafts Wreath Garland Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HmjJTc0HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅🎄【Dimension】Package includes 30 Christmas berry stems and each stem with 15 glitter berries approx. diameter of the fruit 0.6-0.8 inch, stem length approx. 8 inch, 🎄🎅【Light-weight Material】These Christmas berry branches are made of PVC foam balls and glitter powder. They are durable, safe, non-toxic, and environment-friendly. Each berry is equipped with a stick, which makes it strong enough to stand still when put into your Christmas trees or wreaths. The tip of the wire is grind and smooth so that people won't get hurt. But do remember to warn your kids not to poke the wire into eyes or eat it. 🎄🎅【Great picks on Christmas Tree】: These glitter christmas tree picks are perfect for Christmas tree decoration, Xmas wreath decor, Christmas floral arrangements, holiday table centerpieces decor, New Year mantle fireplace decor, wedding,Valentine's day ornaments, etc. Putting a bunch of golden red berries at home will bring much more festival atmosphere. 🎄🎅EASY TO USE: The rose gold holly Stems can be easy bent and operate according to your needs. You can add them to varieties of holiday decoration, or snip off individual berry branches and use them on smaller projects, like decorating gifts, window boxes or other DIY crafts. 🎅🎄Decent Packaging. No damage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HmjJTc0HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uieke","source_asin":"B0BGLC5K38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLC5K38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLC5K38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417635,"name":"Nambe Spinnaker 3-Piece Serving Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bYyC0D4SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Begin or broaden your collection of the spinnaker-inspired designs. The smart, clean, substantial lines and exacting curves of this stainless steel serving set deliver a freshness to the table you set and the food you enjoy. Amazon.com Award-winning designer Frederic Spector created Spinnaker stainless-steel flatware for Nambé to showcase the strength and beauty of simple form rather than ornamentation. Each contemporary piece features a wonderfully thick, bevel-end, straight handle that is flat on top and half-round on the back-truly a pleasure to hold. This set of three Spinnaker serving utensils, all of which measure nine inches in length, complements the five-piece place settings, which are available separately. Included in the set are a serving spoon; serving spoon pierced with a single hole; and a serving fork that is virtually a spoon with almost whimsical bite-like scallops taken out of the top. All feature heads that form sideways ovals, and any two of them could be used as salad servers as well. The 18/10 stainless steel is mirror polished and dishwasher-safe. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Stainless steel, porcelain, and crystal pieces now join Nambé's signature metal alloy ware, all of which is flawlessly crafted and makes exceptional gifts. Nambé has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many prestigious institutions. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bYyC0D4SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B0006VA53A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006VA53A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006VA53A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
