window.products.push({"id":417638,"name":"CAC China TG-8SFL Tango Sunflower Porcelain Plate, 9-Inch, Box of 24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OGhjiFKUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With a long history in the tabletop industry, C.A.C China has been recognized as a trend leader for its innovative patterns and outstanding commercial grade china. C.A.C China’s mission is to provide quality products at affordable prices to the foodservice and hospitality industry. C.A.C China has a variety of durable dinnerware at all levels, including super white porcelain, fine bone china, bone white porcelain, off-white china, colored glaze china, and Asian style china. C.A.C China offers a wide variety of specialty items from tagines, deep, wavy bowls, to bridge platters in multiple sizes that allow chefs to add a little surprise to each course. C.A.C China owns a 60-acre factory in China that ensures affordable pricing and prompt shipment. All products are oven, microwave, and dishwasher safe. Product specifications and descriptions are subject to change without notice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OGhjiFKUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAC China","source_asin":"B00IN724RY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IN724RY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IN724RY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":417639,"name":"HOME-X Ceramic Bird Refrigerator or Whiteboard Magnets, Office Fridge Dry Erase Board Stainless Steel Door Freezer, Locker- 4 pcs- 3 1/8\" L x 2 1/4\" W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+GSzYCb9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you decorating your little girl’s nature-themed bedroom? Maybe you want to add a splash of color and unique patterns to your refrigerator. Whatever your needs, these fun bird magnets do a great job of adding some cheery flair to any space in your home or workplace. Use them as decorations, or post important papers on your refrigerator. They’re perfect for hanging and displaying your kids’ beautiful artwork! This set includes 4 pretty colors: orange, green, purple, and pink. The bright colors really make these magnets stand out from the rest. Use them on a magnetic vision board to make your dreams shine, or bring them into work so you can feel surrounded by nature all day long. Our bird magnets are also amazing party favors for birthdays, garden parties, retirements, baby showers, luncheons, and more. You can bring them to a housewarming party to welcome new friends into the neighborhood! They look cute on magnet boards, mini-fridges, and anywhere else you would display magnets. They’re an adorable gift for magnet collectors and bird-lovers alike. Little kids love getting our bird magnets in their Christmas stockings! These magnets are high quality and resistant to damage. You can keep them on your refrigerator or magnet wall for years! Their happy, colorful appearance is the best way to bring some joy into your home. Whether you’re moving into an apartment, you’re looking for a unique gift, or you just love bird decor, you’ll be impressed with this lovely set of 4 bird magnets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+GSzYCb9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07ZBL1WNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZBL1WNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZBL1WNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
