window.products.push({"id":417983,"name":"Weighted Blanket Medium Navy Blue 12 lbs 42” x 54”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Zi7VClAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recommended for ages 6-10 weight 46 to 70 pounds. The gentle pressure of The Sleep Tight Weighted Blanket provides similar calming effects as swaddling. Use of The Sleep Tight is an effective way to help calm down for sleep and stay asleep. The Sleep Tight design has a curved cut out portion at the top of the blanket. This innovative design allows the blanket to contour around the shoulders and under the chin for a great fit and maximum comfort. To concentrate the weight of the blanket on the body, The Sleep Tight is intentionally designed to be smaller than a regular blanket to most effectively distribute the weight on the body instead of on the bed. The soft corduroy fabric to further encourage calming down for sleep. The Sleep Tight can be worn all night or may be taken off after the person has fallen asleep. As the blanket provides additional insulation, you will want to keep your room at a temperature that prevents the wearer from overheating. Have a good night with your Sleep Tight. Details :The Sleep Tight weighted blanket is very effective with people who have the following diagnoses and difficulties: General stress, Anxiety, Sleep difficulties, Autistic Spectrum Disorders, Sensory Processing Dysfunction and Attention Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder. The blanket is to be used under the supervision of an adult. Materials/Construction: The Sleep Tight is made with 100% cotton corduroy and filled with a non-toxic and hypoallergenic PET pellet material which is BPA and phthalate free. The pellets are sewn into a 100% cotton bag that is inserted in each chamber to prevent the pellets from escaping! Each blanket is double stitched around the outside and then twice on the bottom hem. The corduroy fabric was selected for its softness but also for its durability in holding up to the weight of the blankets. Washing/Drying Instructions: You may machine wash your Sleep Tight and you may dry it in the dryer on low heat or on a drying rack. Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Zi7VClAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B004LK2KNU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004LK2KNU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004LK2KNU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
