window.products.push({"id":417999,"name":"Clear Peni Colada Jello Shot Syringes - 15 Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ogBMN7vuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The groom and the boys can’t have all the fun before the big day, right? Nowadays, women are celebrating their upcoming weddings with their closest friends as well.Contrary to popular notion, bachelorette parties don’t need to involve men in thongs to be considered fun. But a demure tea party as a send-off is not exactly what all brides have in mind If you’re in charge of planning the bachelorette party, how will you get the right mix? One way to get that is by hosting a kinky, jello shots party! Make the party an instant hit with the Jello Shot Syringes by PENI COLADA. These party tools are amazingly easy to use. Fill them first with gelatin and liquor. Freeze them for a few hours, and they’re ready to go. Light and handy, you can bring the frozen jellos to any venue. With the caps on place, there are no leaks so there won’t be any wasted jellos. Without glasses and cups, nothing is getting spilled so it’s zero mess in the party. And here comes the fun part. Dare each other to suck out the jellos, or shoot the jellos into someone’s mouth. For the shared laughs and giggles, everyone (including the bride) will be glad and grateful for how the jello shots party proceeded ●The syringes are easy to clean. You can even reuse them for the next party. ● With 15 prices inside a single pack, you’ll never run out of jello shots. ●Each syringe comes in a 1.5-oz size. A delightful XL size for the size queens of the party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ogBMN7vuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Penn","source_asin":"B00W68YWYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-417999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W68YWYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W68YWYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
